 "_design": "Overlord jab 1 v3 (ANIM-JAB-5, 2026-11-12) from cards/overlord/jab/overlord_jab_v3_pose_plan.md: contemptuous backhand slap, right hand, left forearm flat on the belly. f2 break (pelvis first), f4 chamber coiled 120 deg left with the hand at the left jaw and the elbow at the target, f5 drive hips first with a small right-foot stomp, f6 contact side-on with the straight arm on the +Y line at shoulder +8 cm, chin up; f7 wrist flick, f8 overshoot, f12 disdain hold; recovery f13-22 with the right foot stepping back f15-19; idle at f28. r2: contact is a diagonal backhand onto the dummy's upper chest (29 deg at f6 opening to 36 deg f8-f12), left hand on the left hip f5-f12.",
 "_changes": "v3: new card, nothing reused from v2 (rejected in game as static). r1 (2026-11-14, offline, owner notes round 1): f6-f12 contact is a diagonal 40 deg right of +Y (shoulder line on the same line, hand 30 cm outside the right shoulder seen from behind), legs long f5-f12 (pelvis 0..+0.5 cm, knees <= 23), hold drifts 4.5 cm (rise, chin up, arm back to the line), new key f1 at 45% of the coil, f2 chest at 68% of the chamber, f4 hand 3.5 cm off spine_05 (offline), left heel no longer rises (planted exemption removed). Backup: overlord_jab1_v3.r0.backup.json. r2 (2026-11-15, offline, review r1): contact centred on the dummy (wrist x -17, y 78, z 134 at f6, arm 29 deg right of +Y, opening to ~38 at f8), body shifted left/forward (pelvis +3/+14, chest lean 26 fwd, trunk yaw -73, stomp 17 cm), left hand at the left hip f5-f12, dense keys (in-betweens baked). Backup: overlord_jab1_v3.r1.backup.json. r2b (2026-11-15, offline, in-game capture: montage starts at position 0 with no blend-in): f0 is no longer idle (FEEL RULE) = old f1 'leave'; new f1 'load' between old f1 and old f2; f2/f3 = old f2/f3; f4+ untouched. Backup: overlord_jab1_v3.r2a.backup.json. r3 (2026-11-15): owner's Cascadeur poses are the base (owner_r3/), full arc with follow-through past the owner's last key, built by jab_r3_plans.py + pose_plan.py. v3 r2b card kept as overlord_jab1_v3.r2b.backup.json.",
